  # to correct) and READ FROM THE RECORD (zenodo.org/records/22421817), not
  # guessed: version 2.9.0, the "New in 2.9.0" paragraph present at minting —
  # exact diacritics and the postings-shard search, no text changed, deposit
  # bthar-mx/OSBCT-v2.9.0.zip, 398.7 MB (the first deposit under the
  # organisation's name).  SIXTH CONSECUTIVE DEPOSIT to arrive describing
  # itself correctly.  No in-place correction needed.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22421817"
    description: "Zenodo archive of v2.9.0 (5 September 2026)"
  # Minted 2026-08-16 and READ FROM THE RECORD (zenodo.org/records/21967270),
