  # in which the text actually changed.  No in-place correction needed.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21864177"
    description: "Zenodo archive of v2.7.1 (9 August 2026)"
  # Minted 2026-08-09 and READ FROM THE RECORD ITSELF (zenodo.org/records/21863987),
