  # Minted 2026-08-08, read from the record itself (zenodo.org/records/21853330),
  # not guessed.  FIRST DEPOSIT TO ARRIVE DESCRIBING ITSELF CORRECTLY: version
  # 2.5.0 and the "New in 2.5.0" paragraph were on the record at minting,
  # because both metadata files were committed and pushed BEFORE the tag was
  # cut — the ordering the v2.4.0 erratum prescribed, followed for the first
  # time.  No in-place correction was needed.
  - type: doi
